                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "-Includes the VR Zombies games like you’ve never seen them before. \nBy that they mean \n-terrible animations\n-Worse sound effects\n-non-existent feeling guns\n-Bugs\n-And an overall gameplay experience that feels unfinished. \n-Every mob has their own unique sound effect. One, one that repeats nonstop.\n\n2/5\n\nYou can tell this was someones first vr project and they didn't quite know what they were doing. It's buggy, the guns all feel sloppy. The animations are horrible and the sound effects are very irritating, controls are a little sloppy feeling. Just the overall game feels unfinished and not that impressive. Also, it's the laziest form of a VR game anyone can make --- a wave shooter. \n\n[Quote] If you liked this review Make sure to [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33220185-VR-Games-and-Tools/]Click here[/url] and give a follow for more reviews of good, bad and decent VR titles. And [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/HonestVR/]Click here[/url] if you want to request reviews on other VR titles. [/Quote]",
